The actor Nakamura Fukusuke IV in the role of Kōbei in the play Uzuki no Momiji  卯月の紅葉, staged at the Naniwa-za, Osaka in August 1915. One of seven prints by the artist that appeared in the magazine Shin Nigao whose purpose was to advertise the Kabuki theater and renew interest in actor prints.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SHIN NIGAO (NEW ACTOR PORTRAITS)&lt;br&gt;
