The actor Ichikawa Sadanji II in the role of Togashi, staged at the Shintomi-za Theater in April 1915. One of fourteen prints by the artist that appeared in the magazine Shin Nigao whose purpose was to advertise the Kabuki theater and renew interest in actor prints.
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SHIN NIGAO (NEW ACTOR PORTRAITS)&lt;br&gt;
