An untitled postcard-size print attributed to the shin hanga artist Kawase Hasui (see comment under &quot;Seal&quot;) that is very similar in design to a chūban-size print by the shin hanga known as artist Takahashi Shōtei 高橋松亭 (1871-1945) known as &quot;Snow at Ozawa; Torii Gate and a Cottage.&quot;
