Small format reproduction, undated (c. 1930s), after Isoda Koryūsai&#39;s 1770-1772 work &quot;Fujibakama,&quot; from the series &quot;Genji in Fashionable Modern Guise.&quot;  The publisher of this print was Yokohama-based Hideo Takemura (H. Takemura &amp; Co.) who targeted his work at a Western audience, specializing in, as printed on his business card, Christmas Cards, Japanese Old Colour Prints, Famous Modern Colour Prints and Water Colors. 
