This small format print of a bijin with umbrella in a gentle snowfall is signed 延雪 (Nobuyuki), a female ukiyo-e artist who studied under the famous Meiji era artist Yōshū Chikanobu 楊洲周延 (1838-1912). Nobuyuki&#39;s name is seen as Suzuki Nobuyuki 鈴木延雪 as well as Utagawa Nobuyuki 歌川. This print can be found in two different color schemes. 
