An undated (c. 1930s) small format reproduction mounted to a greeting card, loosely based on one of four pictures in Hiroshige&#39;s 1856 harimaze-e print Fuchū, Nichō-machi, No. 6 from the series Pictures of the Fifty-Three Stations of the Tokaido.

