The actor Sawamura Sōnosuke in the role of Kinokuniya Koharu 紀の国屋小春 in the play Shinjū Ten no Amijima 心中天網島 performed at the Teikoku Gekijō, Tokyo on June 3, 1915. One of twelve prints by the artist that appeared in the magazine Shin Nigao whose purpose was to advertise the Kabuki theater and renew interest in actor prints.
