Nakazawa presents us with a view of a thick horizontal branch of the 600-year-old Yōryu no matsu pine tree behind a low wooden fence at Yoshimine-dera the 20th temple along the Saigoku Kannon Pilgrimage. The roof of a temple building is seen in the midground and the hills of Nishiyama stretch across the print&#39;s background.&lt;br&gt;
