An illustration of the stage set for Shinpan Utazaimon (The New Scandalous Ballad of Osome and Hisamatsu) written by Chikamatsu Hanji 近松半二 (1725-1783) and first staged in 1780.&lt;br&gt;

This set presents us with Hisamatsu&#39;s parents home at Nozaki Village where the love triangle between Hisamatsu, Osome and Omitsu will play out.&lt;br&gt;

